diff --git a/CHANGELOG.rst b/CHANGELOG.rst
index e166f03..2e7e113 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.rst
+++ b/CHANGELOG.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
+Unreleased
+==========
+
+- Rename ``TTLCache.expire()`` and ``TLRUCache.expire()`` parameter
+  ``time`` to ``now``.  The ``time`` keyword argument is deprecated
+  and will be removed in a future release.
+
+- Add ``TTLCache.ttl`` setter.
+
+
 v7.2.8 (2026-10-31)
 ===================
 
